    "DB3FAC sets EBP to entity this+8; acquisition DB404D/DB4078 binds that actor to stack20 at priority3.",
    "DB402C zeroes callee-saved EDI. It stays zero through the home loop; movement DB416B..DB417C pushes final flag1 then three EDI zeros then stack168 position.",
    "Home slot0x1C DB40A0 writes stack300 and returns its pointer for the initial 0.1 distance. DB40D0 writes a separate stack168 snapshot; loop backedge DB41BD targets DB40D3 after that snapshot call.",
